  "aliases": [],
  "summary": "矩形分割图：一块矩形按数值占比递归劈成嵌套子块，面积就是数值；2 层嵌套、4 大类 11 个子项，悬停显示「名称 · 数值 · 占比」。",
  "usage": "磁盘占用、预算分配、分类占比、组织人员分布这类层级占比数据；2 层结构、8–15 个节点最清晰，桌面端悬停看明细。",
  "caution": "节点超过 15 个会碎成细条、标签只能隐藏，改用可折叠树；环形层级用旭日图；单条趋势用迷你趋势线。",
  "hint": "悬停或按 Tab 聚焦任意色块，查看名称、数值和占比",
  "inspiration": "",
  "prompt": "【树图（矩形分割图 / Treemap）】目标：用矩形面积表达层级占比——一块大矩形按数值递归劈成嵌套子块，面积 = 数值；2 层嵌套（大类 + 子类），悬停显示「名称 · 数值 · 占比」。\n\n1) 结构：.panel（卡片 340×158、圆角 12；弹窗 680×640、圆角 18）> .head（标题 11/16px + 右侧 meta 8.5/11.5px）> .stage > svg（flex:1，每次重建前按实际像素重设 viewBox）。块用 `<g class=\"grp\">`（大类）和 `<g class=\"blk\">`（子类），每个 g 里一个 `<rect>` + 1–2 个 `<text>`；最后再补一层 `<rect class=\"goutline\">`（fill:none、pointer-events:none）画在大类边框上，给悬停描边用。\n\n2) 布局算法（手写 squarified treemap，不引 d3）：待排项按值降序，归一化面积 = v × 画布面积 / 总和；逐行排：每轮贪心把后续项加入当前行，用 worst(row, rowArea, 矩形短边) = max(条厚/项长, 项长/条厚) 判断，长宽比不再下降就收行；矩形宽≥高则竖排一列（列宽 = 行面积/矩形高），否则横排一行（行高 = 行面积/矩形宽），继续到排完。大类排完后再对大类的子区递归一次。示例数据：媒体 148（视频 82/照片 41/音乐 25）、开发 96（依赖包 44/系统镜像 32/构建产物 20）、文档 58（设计稿 21/PDF 20/笔记 17）、其他 34（系统备份 18/下载 16），共 336 GB。\n\n3) 间隙：每块各内缩 1px → 块间 2px；大类矩形先内缩 1px，内部留 22px（弹窗）/ 12px（卡片）的标题带，子区从标题带下方开始、左右再各留 4px/2px。\n\n4) 配色只用 --ui-*：四个大类基准 BASE=[92,70,50,34]（差 20 以上才分得清），大类底色 = BASE[gi]×0.45% 的 brand 混合 surface；子块 tint = max(22, BASE[gi] − rank×13)，fill = color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-brand) tint%, var(--ui-surface))。文字色：tint ≥ 54 用 var(--ui-bg)，否则 var(--ui-text)——这样浅色主题（深块白字）和深色主题（亮块深字）都成立。\n\n5) 标签：大类在标题带左边写名称（12/7px，600），右边写占比（text-anchor:end、--ui-text-dim）；子块内优先两行「名称 / 82 GB · 24%」，放不下退成单行「名称 24%」，再放不下只写名称，再小就整块不写。宽度用「汉字 = 字号、其它 = 字号×0.56」估算判断，不要用 getBBox。\n\n6) 悬停：svg 上 pointermove 做事件委托，closest('.grp,.blk') 取 data-i；高亮块 rect 换成 var(--ui-brand) 描边（2px / 弹窗 2.8px），其余块 opacity .28；悬停子类时它所属大类一起保留（并点亮 goutline）；顶部 meta 换成「视频 · 82 GB · 24%」。pointerleave 清空。\n\n7) 键盘：每块 tabindex=\"0\" + aria-label（名称、数值、占比），focusin 触发同样的高亮，Esc 清除；focus() 一律带 preventScroll。\n\n8) 自动演示（只在 window.__uiInteractive 为假时跑）：用 window.__uiDemoCursor() 的光标在「媒体 → 视频 → 依赖包 → 设计稿 → 系统备份」之间做 0.68 秒缓动插值移动（每帧调一次 cursor.at），每到一处高亮 1.2 秒再清空；一轮结束 cursor.hide()，0.9 秒后重来。prefers-reduced-motion 下完全不跑。\n\n9) 坑：① 首帧 getBoundingClientRect 可能为 0，延迟 200 毫秒重试；② 重建 DOM 前先清空 svg 并把 hover 状态复位；③ ResizeObserver 回调里宽高没变就别重建（会闪）；④ 子区高度 ≤ 8px 时不再递归，否则会算出负高度。\n\n10) 无障碍：svg role=\"group\" + aria-label 说明数据规模；每块 role=\"listitem\"；focus-visible 有 brand 描边。usage/caution 见字段。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html,body{height:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:8px;overflow:hidden}\n  .panel{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:100%;max-width:340px;height:158px;padding:8px 10px 7px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ui-surface);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-surface));border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 14%,transparent);box-shadow:0 8px 22px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 8%,transparent);overflow:hidden}\n  .head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;flex:0 0 auto;min-height:13px}\n  .title{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.2px;white-space:nowrap;flex:0 0 auto}\n  .meta{font-size:8.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;flex:1 1 auto;text-align:right}\n  .meta.on{color:var(--ui-brand)}\n  .stage{position:relative;flex:1 1 auto;min-height:0;margin-top:4px}\n  svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:visible}\n  .grp,.blk{cursor:default;outline:none;transition:opacity .16s ease}\n  .grp rect,.blk rect{stroke:transparent;stroke-width:1;transition:stroke .16s ease}\n  .grp.dim,.blk.dim{opacity:.28}\n  .grp.hl rect,.blk.hl rect{stroke:var(--ui-brand);stroke-width:2}\n  .goutline{stroke-width:2;transition:stroke .16s ease}\n  .goutline.on{stroke:var(--ui-brand)}\n  .blk:focus-visible rect,.grp:focus-visible rect{stroke:var(--ui-brand);stroke-width:2.2}\n  .grp text,.blk text{pointer-events:none}\n  @media (min-height:421px){\n    body{padding:24px}\n    .panel{max-width:680px;height:min(640px,100%);padding:18px 22px 16px;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 18px 48px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent)}\n    .head{min-height:20px;gap:14px}\n    .title{font-size:16px}\n    .meta{font-size:11.5px}\n    .stage{margin-top:10px}\n    .grp rect,.blk rect{stroke-width:1.5}\n    .grp.hl rect,.blk.hl rect{stroke-width:2.8}\n    .goutline{stroke-width:2.8}\n  }\n  @media (max-height:420px){\n    body{padding:8px}\n    .panel{height:158px}\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n    .grp,.blk,.grp rect,.blk rect,.goutline{transition:none}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"panel\" id=\"panel\">\n  <div class=\"head\">\n    <span class=\"title\">磁盘占用</span>\n    <span class=\"meta\" id=\"meta\">共 336 GB · 4 类 15 项</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stage\">\n    <svg id=\"tm\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"磁盘占用矩形树图：4 个大类、15 个项，矩形面积代表占用大小\"></svg>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var NS='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';\n  var svg=document.getElementById('tm'),\n      metaEl=document.getElementById('meta'),\n      panel=document.getElementById('panel');\n  var INTERACTIVE=!!window.__uiInteractive;\n  var REDUCED=false;\n  try{ REDUCED=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches; }catch(e){}\n\n  var DATA=[\n    {name:'媒体',items:[{name:'视频',v:82},{name:'照片',v:41},{name:'音乐',v:25}]},\n    {name:'开发',items:[{name:'依赖包',v:44},{name:'系统镜像',v:32},{name:'构建产物',v:20}]},\n    {name:'文档',items:[{name:'设计稿',v:21},{name:'PDF',v:20},{name:'笔记',v:17}]},\n    {name:'其他',items:[{name:'系统备份',v:18},{name:'下载',v:16}]}\n  ];\n  var TOTAL=0, flat=[], gFlat=[], outlineEls=[];\n  DATA.forEach(function(g,gi){\n    g.gi=gi; g.v=0;\n    g.items.forEach(function(it,ii){ it.gi=gi; it.ii=ii; it.parent=g; g.v+=it.v; TOTAL+=it.v; });\n  });\n  DATA.forEach(function(g,gi){\n    gFlat[gi]=flat.length;\n    flat.push({kind:'g',gi:gi,name:g.name,v:g.v});\n    g.items.forEach(function(it){ it.flat=flat.length; flat.push({kind:'l',gi:gi,name:it.name,v:it.v}); });\n  });\n\n  var BASE=[92,70,50,34];\n  var active=-1, W=0, H=0, BIG=false, els=[];\n\n  function tw(s,fs){\n    var w=0;\n    for(var i=0;i<s.length;i++) w += s.charCodeAt(i)>255 ? fs : fs*0.56;\n    return w;\n  }\n  function fgOf(tint){ return tint>=54 ? 'var(--ui-bg)' : 'var(--ui-text)'; }\n  function grpTint(gi){ return Math.round(BASE[gi]*0.45); }\n  function leafTint(gi,rank){ return Math.max(22, BASE[gi]-rank*13); }\n\n  function worst(row,area,side){\n    if(!(area>0)||!(side>0)) return Infinity;\n    var thick=area/side, mx=0;\n    for(var i=0;i<row.length;i++){\n      var len=row[i].area/thick;\n      var r = len>thick ? len/thick : thick/len;\n      if(r>mx) mx=r;\n    }\n    return mx;\n  }\n\n  function squarify(items,x,y,w,h){\n    var total=0,i;\n    for(i=0;i<items.length;i++) total+=items[i].v;\n    if(total<=0||w<=0||h<=0) return [];\n    var scale=w*h/total;\n    var nodes=[];\n    for(i=0;i<items.length;i++) nodes.push({it:items[i],area:Math.max(0.0001,items[i].v*scale)});\n    var out=[], pos=0, rx=x, ry=y, rw=w, rh=h;\n    while(pos<nodes.length && rw>0.5 && rh>0.5){\n      var row=[], rowArea=0, best=Infinity, p=pos;\n      var side=Math.min(rw,rh);\n      while(p<nodes.length){\n        var ta=rowArea+nodes[p].area;\n        var tr=row.concat([nodes[p]]);\n        var ratio=worst(tr,ta,side);\n        if(ratio<=best){ best=ratio; row=tr; rowArea=ta; p++; }\n        else break;\n      }\n      if(!row.length){ row=[nodes[pos]]; rowArea=nodes[pos].area; p=pos+1; }\n      var k, cur;\n      if(rw>=rh){\n        var cw=rowArea/rh;\n        cur=ry;\n        for(k=0;k<row.length;k++){\n          var ih=row[k].area/cw;\n          out.push({item:row[k].it,x:rx,y:cur,w:cw,h:ih});\n          cur+=ih;\n        }\n        rx+=cw; rw-=cw;\n      }else{\n        var hh=rowArea/rw;\n        cur=rx;\n        for(k=0;k<row.length;k++){\n          var iw=row[k].area/hh;\n          out.push({item:row[k].it,x:cur,y:ry,w:iw,h:hh});\n          cur+=iw;\n        }\n        ry+=hh; rh-=hh;\n      }\n      pos=p;\n    }\n    return out;\n  }\n\n  function mkRect(x,y,w,h,fill,rx){\n    var r=document.createElementNS(NS,'rect');\n    r.setAttribute('x',x.toFixed(2));\n    r.setAttribute('y',y.toFixed(2));\n    r.setAttribute('width',Math.max(1,w).toFixed(2));\n    r.setAttribute('height',Math.max(1,h).toFixed(2));\n    if(rx) r.setAttribute('rx',rx);\n    if(fill) r.style.fill=fill;\n    return r;\n  }\n  function mkText(str,x,y,fs,fill,anchor,weight){\n    var t=document.createElementNS(NS,'text');\n    t.setAttribute('x',x.toFixed(2));\n    t.setAttribute('y',y.toFixed(2));\n    t.setAttribute('font-size',fs);\n    t.setAttribute('fill',fill);\n    t.setAttribute('text-anchor',anchor||'start');\n    if(weight) t.setAttribute('font-weight',weight);\n    t.textContent=str;\n    return t;\n  }\n\n  function build(){\n    var box=svg.getBoundingClientRect();\n    if(!box.width||!box.height) return false;\n    W=Math.round(box.width); H=Math.round(box.height);\n    if(W<40||H<30) return false;\n    svg.setAttribute('viewBox','0 0 '+W+' '+H);\n    BIG=matchMedia('(min-height:421px)').matches;\n    while(svg.firstChild) svg.removeChild(svg.firstChild);\n    els=[]; outlineEls=[]; active=-1;\n\n    var fsG=BIG?12:7, fsL=BIG?11.5:6.5, headH=BIG?22:12, ipad=BIG?4:2;\n\n    var order=DATA.slice().sort(function(a,b){ return b.v-a.v; });\n    var top=squarify(order,0,0,W,H);\n    var parts=[];\n    top.forEach(function(o){\n      var g=o.item;\n      var P={g:g,x:o.x+1,y:o.y+1,w:Math.max(8,o.w-2),h:Math.max(8,o.h-2)};\n      var ix=P.x+ipad, iy=P.y+headH, iw=P.w-ipad*2, ih=P.h-headH-ipad;\n      if(iw>8 && ih>8){\n        var its=g.items.slice().sort(function(a,b){ return b.v-a.v; });\n        its.forEach(function(it,k){ it.rank=k; });\n        P.leaves=squarify(its,ix,iy,iw,ih);\n      }\n      parts.push(P);\n    });\n\n    parts.forEach(function(P){\n      var g=P.g;\n      var el=document.createElementNS(NS,'g');\n      el.setAttribute('class','grp');\n      el.setAttribute('data-i',gFlat[g.gi]);\n      el.setAttribute('tabindex','0');\n      el.setAttribute('role','listitem');\n      el.setAttribute('aria-label',g.name+'，'+g.v+' GB，占 '+Math.round(g.v/TOTAL*100)+'%');\n      el.appendChild(mkRect(P.x,P.y,P.w,P.h,'color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) '+grpTint(g.gi)+'%,var(--ui-surface))',BIG?4:2));\n      var nmW=tw(g.name,fsG);\n      var pctS=Math.round(g.v/TOTAL*100)+'%';\n      if(P.w>nmW+8 && P.h>headH+1){\n        var by=P.y+headH*(BIG?0.66:0.74);\n        el.appendChild(mkText(g.name,P.x+(BIG?7:4),by,fsG,'var(--ui-text)','start','600'));\n        if(P.w>nmW+tw(pctS,fsG)+20){\n          el.appendChild(mkText(pctS,P.x+P.w-(BIG?7:4),by,fsG,'var(--ui-text-dim)','end'));\n        }\n      }\n      svg.appendChild(el);\n      els.push(el);\n      var fg=flat[gFlat[g.gi]];\n      fg.cx=P.x+P.w/2;\n      fg.cy=P.y+Math.min(headH,P.h)/2;\n    });\n\n    parts.forEach(function(P){\n      if(!P.leaves) return;\n      P.leaves.forEach(function(lo){\n        var it=lo.item;\n        var x=lo.x+1, y=lo.y+1, w=Math.max(2,lo.w-2), h=Math.max(2,lo.h-2);\n        var tint=leafTint(P.g.gi,it.rank);\n        var f=fgOf(tint);\n        var pctS=Math.round(it.v/TOTAL*100)+'%';\n        var el=document.createElementNS(NS,'g');\n        el.setAttribute('class','blk');\n        el.setAttribute('data-i',it.flat);\n        el.setAttribute('tabindex','0');\n        el.setAttribute('role','listitem');\n        el.setAttribute('aria-label',it.name+'，'+it.v+' GB，占 '+pctS);\n        el.appendChild(mkRect(x,y,w,h,'color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) '+tint+'%,var(--ui-surface))',BIG?4:1.5));\n        var cx=x+w/2, cy=y+h/2;\n        var nmW=tw(it.name,fsL);\n        if(BIG){\n          var sub=it.v+' GB · '+pctS, subW=tw(sub,fsL*0.84);\n          if(w>=nmW+12 && h>=fsL*2+13 && w>=subW+12){\n            el.appendChild(mkText(it.name,cx,cy-fsL*0.38,fsL,f,'middle','600'));\n            var st=mkText(sub,cx,cy+fsL*0.98,fsL*0.84,f,'middle');\n            st.setAttribute('opacity','.85');\n            el.appendChild(st);\n          }else if(w>=nmW+8 && h>=fsL+8){\n            el.appendChild(mkText(it.name,cx,cy+fsL*0.36,fsL,f,'middle','600'));\n          }\n        }else{\n          var one=it.name+' '+pctS;\n          if(w>=tw(one,fsL)+5 && h>=fsL+4){\n            el.appendChild(mkText(one,cx,cy+fsL*0.36,fsL,f,'middle','600'));\n          }else if(w>=nmW+4 && h>=fsL+3){\n            el.appendChild(mkText(it.name,cx,cy+fsL*0.36,fsL,f,'middle','600'));\n          }\n        }\n        svg.appendChild(el);\n        els.push(el);\n        flat[it.flat].cx=cx;\n        flat[it.flat].cy=cy;\n      });\n    });\n\n    parts.forEach(function(P){\n      var o=document.createElementNS(NS,'rect');\n      o.setAttribute('class','goutline');\n      o.setAttribute('data-g',P.g.gi);\n      o.setAttribute('x',P.x.toFixed(2));\n      o.setAttribute('y',P.y.toFixed(2));\n      o.setAttribute('width',Math.max(1,P.w).toFixed(2));\n      o.setAttribute('height',Math.max(1,P.h).toFixed(2));\n      o.setAttribute('rx',BIG?4:2);\n      o.setAttribute('fill','none');\n      o.setAttribute('pointer-events','none');\n      svg.appendChild(o);\n      outlineEls.push(o);\n    });\n    return true;\n  }\n\n  function setActive(id){\n    if(id===active) return;\n    active=id;\n    var on=id>=0, keep={};\n    if(on){\n      var f=flat[id];\n      keep[id]=1;\n      if(f.kind==='g'){\n        DATA[f.gi].items.forEach(function(it){ keep[it.flat]=1; });\n      }else{\n        keep[gFlat[f.gi]]=1;\n      }\n    }\n    for(var k=0;k<els.length;k++){\n      var el=els[k], j=+el.getAttribute('data-i');\n      el.classList.toggle('dim',on&&!keep[j]);\n      el.classList.toggle('hl',on&&j===id);\n    }\n    for(k=0;k<outlineEls.length;k++){\n      outlineEls[k].classList.toggle('on',on&&flat[id].kind==='g'&&flat[id].gi===k);\n    }\n    if(on){\n      var f2=flat[id];\n      metaEl.textContent=f2.name+' · '+f2.v+' GB · '+Math.round(f2.v/TOTAL*100)+'%';\n      metaEl.classList.add('on');\n    }else{\n      metaEl.textContent='共 '+TOTAL+' GB · '+DATA.length+' 类 '+flat.length+' 项';\n      metaEl.classList.remove('on');\n    }\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- 光标演示 ---------- */\n  var timers=[], stops=[], cur=null, pos={x:0,y:0};\n\n  function after(ms,fn){ var t=setTimeout(fn,ms); timers.push(t); return t; }\n  function clearTimers(){ for(var i=0;i<timers.length;i++) clearTimeout(timers[i]); timers=[]; }\n  function stopAnims(){ for(var i=0;i<stops.length;i++){ try{ stops[i](); }catch(e){} } stops=[]; }\n\n  function moveCur(x,y){\n    if(!cur) return;\n    if(typeof cur.at==='function') cur.at(x,y);\n  }\n\n  function glide(to,dur,cb){\n    if(!cur) return;\n    var from={x:pos.x,y:pos.y}, t0=performance.now(), dead=false, raf=0;\n    function tick(ts){\n      if(dead) return;\n      var t=Math.min(1,(ts-t0)/dur);\n      var e=t<.5 ? 2*t*t : 1-Math.pow(-2*t+2,2)/2;\n      pos.x=from.x+(to.x-from.x)*e;\n      pos.y=from.y+(to.y-from.y)*e;\n      moveCur(pos.x,pos.y);\n      if(t<1) raf=requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n      else if(cb) cb();\n    }\n    raf=requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n    stops.push(function(){ dead=true; cancelAnimationFrame(raf); });\n  }\n\n  function runDemo(){\n    if(INTERACTIVE||REDUCED) return;\n    clearTimers(); stopAnims(); setActive(-1);\n    cur=window.__uiDemoCursor?window.__uiDemoCursor():null;\n    if(!cur) return;\n    var box=svg.getBoundingClientRect();\n    if(!box.width||!box.height){ after(300,runDemo); return; }\n\n    var want=[];\n    flat.forEach(function(f,idx){\n      if(f.kind==='g'&&f.name==='媒体') want.push(idx);\n    });\n    ['视频','依赖包','设计稿','系统备份'].forEach(function(nm){\n      flat.forEach(function(f,idx){ if(f.name===nm) want.push(idx); });\n    });\n    if(want.length<2) return;\n\n    pos={x:box.left+box.width*0.5, y:box.top+box.height*0.5};\n    moveCur(pos.x,pos.y);\n\n    var k=0;\n    function go(){\n      if(INTERACTIVE||REDUCED) return;\n      if(k>=want.length){\n        setActive(-1);\n        if(cur&&cur.hide) cur.hide();\n        after(900,function(){ runDemo(); });\n        return;\n      }\n      var idx=want[k];\n      if(!isFinite(flat[idx].cx)){ k++; go(); return; }\n      var to={x:box.left+flat[idx].cx, y:box.top+flat[idx].cy};\n      glide(to,680,function(){\n        setActive(idx);\n        after(1250,function(){\n          setActive(-1);\n          after(240,function(){ k++; go(); });\n        });\n      });\n    }\n    after(240,go);\n  }\n\n  if(INTERACTIVE){\n    svg.addEventListener('pointermove',function(e){\n      var g=e.target.closest?e.target.closest('.grp,.blk'):null;\n      setActive(g?+g.getAttribute('data-i'):-1);\n    });\n    svg.addEventListener('pointerleave',function(){ setActive(-1); });\n    svg.addEventListener('focusin',function(e){\n      var g=e.target.closest?e.target.closest('.grp,.blk'):null;\n      if(g) setActive(+g.getAttribute('data-i'));\n    });\n    svg.addEventListener('focusout',function(){ setActive(-1); });\n    svg.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){\n      if(e.key==='Escape'){\n        setActive(-1);\n        if(document.activeElement && document.activeElement.blur) document.activeElement.blur();\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  var rt=0;\n  function onResize(){\n    clearTimeout(rt);\n    rt=setTimeout(function(){\n      var box=svg.getBoundingClientRect();\n      if(!box.width||!box.height) return;\n      if(Math.round(box.width)===W && Math.round(box.height)===H) return;\n      clearTimers(); stopAnims();\n      if(!build()) return;\n      if(!INTERACTIVE) runDemo();\n    },160);\n  }\n\n  function boot(){\n    if(!build()){ setTimeout(boot,200); return; }\n    if(!INTERACTIVE) runDemo();\n  }\n\n  if(window.ResizeObserver){\n    try{ new ResizeObserver(onResize).observe(panel); }\n    catch(e){ window.addEventListener('resize',onResize); }\n  }else{\n    window.addEventListener('resize',onResize);\n  }\n\n  boot();\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
